544255 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544708 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "730a83f8-2630-58ea-b90c-e36feb412b1d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544727 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186544238 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544727 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186544265 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544727 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186544499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544727 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186544560 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544727 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186544630 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544727 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544727 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544727 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186544560 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544727 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "a4f8ba87-584e-5b9c-b10e-58f5d8d221b1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544762 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186544090 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544762 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186544091 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544762 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186544436 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544762 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186544494 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544762 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186544629 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544762 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544762 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544762 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186544091 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544762 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "e449d4e6-5069-5c0a-ac4d-1bc5e9e548d0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544779 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186544244 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544779 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186544297 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544779 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186544427 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544779 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186544460 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544779 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186544555 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544779 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544779 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544779 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186544297 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544779 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "fe767b7b-e724-5de1-8c65-84a86b708adc" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544787 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186544779 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544787 #edb/ref 1069 "q-164125" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544787 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544787 #edb/ref 1071 "Let $R=[2,4]\\times [1,2]$ be a region in the $xy$-plane, and let $f(x,y)=16-2x-y.$\nFurther, let $P$ be a partition of $R,$ where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{1}=\\{{x}_{0},{x}_{1},…,{x}_{m}\\},\\,{P}_{2}=\\{{y}_{0},{y}_{1},…,{y}_{n}\\},\\,P={P}_{1}\\times {P}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nGiven that the lower Riemann sum of $f$ with respect to $P$ is given by\n\n$$\nL(f,P)={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}\\boxed{}\\,Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\n$$\n\nwhere $Δ{x}_{i}={x}_{i}-{x}_{i-1}$ and $Δ{y}_{j}={y}_{j}-{y}_{j-1},$ what is the missing expression in the double summation above?" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544787 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "086ea7e4-b45d-5b48-92bf-b7fd8532a3af" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544787 #edb/ref 1074 "The lower Riemann sum is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{m}_{ij}Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${m}_{ij}$ is the *minimum* value of $f$ in each subregion ${R}_{ij}.$ \n\nWe consider an arbitrary subregion ${R}_{ij}$ of the partition. This subregion lies between ${x}_{i-1}$ and ${x}_{i}$ over the $x$-axis and ${y}_{i-1}$ and ${y}_{i}$ over the $y$-axis, as shown below. \n\n![](images/88/88ffe30ae5401e00502b35d851b216768aad69bf94236561617adf23e1ce058f.png)\n\nNotice that:\n\n- $f(x,y)=16-2x-y$ decreases as $x$ increases, and\n\n- $f(x,y)=16-2x-y$ decreases as $y$ increases.\n\n![](images/ce/ce0d90127e1f14654f4b32a933f1eb6e76e054c03f19ca40c3f04116aa3c2c93.png)\n\nAs a result, the *minimum* value of $f$ in each subregion is attained when we have the *largest* possible $x$ and the *largest* possible $y.$ This is the value at the *top right corner* of each subregion. \n\n![](images/4a/4a10c8332a5f346d393c37531c13db6aa69d4cecb241efd7c34d57f32d5a98b8.png)\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{m}_{ij} & =f({x}_{i},{y}_{j})=16-2{x}_{i}-{y}_{j}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the lower Riemann sum is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(16-{x}_{i}-{y}_{j})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is $16-2{x}_{i}-{y}_{j}.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544799 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186544708 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544799 #edb/ref 1069 "q-75352" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544799 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544799 #edb/ref 1071 "Let $R=[1,3]\\times [2,9]$ be a region in the $xy$-plane, and let $f(x,y)=11y-6x.$\nFurther, let $P$ be a partition of $R,$ where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{1}=\\{{x}_{0},{x}_{1},…,{x}_{m}\\},\\,{P}_{2}=\\{{y}_{0},{y}_{1},…,{y}_{n}\\},\\,P={P}_{1}\\times {P}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nGiven that the lower Riemann sum of $f$ with respect to $P$ is given by\n\n$$\nL(f,P)={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}\\boxed{}\\,Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\n$$\n\nwhere $Δ{x}_{i}={x}_{i}-{x}_{i-1}$ and $Δ{y}_{j}={y}_{j}-{y}_{j-1},$ what is the missing expression in the double summation above?" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544799 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "27a8dfe2-6a96-5884-8d1c-c8b7f914c19a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544799 #edb/ref 1074 "The lower Riemann sum is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{m}_{ij}Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${m}_{ij}$ is the *minimum* value of $f$ in each subregion ${R}_{ij}.$ \n\nWe consider an arbitrary subregion ${R}_{ij}$ of the partition. This subregion lies between ${x}_{i-1}$ and ${x}_{i}$ over the $x$-axis and ${y}_{i-1}$ and ${y}_{i}$ over the $y$-axis, as shown below. \n\n![](images/88/88ffe30ae5401e00502b35d851b216768aad69bf94236561617adf23e1ce058f.png)\n\nNotice that:\n\n- $f(x,y)=11y-6x$ decreases as $x$ increases, and\n\n- $f(x,y)=11y-6x$ increases as $y$ increases.\n\n![](images/ff/ffa57d3e7fed08212f12d4b9d7c2e0a4d33a3aac71c8b8a03d1a9a7364484deb.png)\n\nAs a result, the *minimum* value of $f$ in each subregion is attained when we have the *largest* possible $x$ and the *smallest* possible $y.$ This is the value at the *bottom right corner* of each subregion.\n\n![](images/c4/c4aa9e96fe72a8fb31ab62ff7eb0695cc64992bb9433be516461915a5c92baff.png)\n\n \n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{m}_{ij} & =f({x}_{i},{y}_{j-1})=11{y}_{j-1}-6{x}_{i}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the lower Riemann sum is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(11{y}_{j-1}-6{x}_{i})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is $11{y}_{j-1}-6{x}_{i}.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544816 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186544762 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544816 #edb/ref 1069 "q-75306" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544816 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544816 #edb/ref 1071 "Let $R=[3,4]\\times [-5,-1]$ be a region in the $xy$-plane, and let $f(x,y)=2x+y.$\nFurther, let $P$ be a partition of $R,$ where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{1}=\\{{x}_{0},{x}_{1},…,{x}_{m}\\},\\,{P}_{2}=\\{{y}_{0},{y}_{1},…,{y}_{n}\\},\\,P={P}_{1}\\times {P}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nGiven that the lower Riemann sum of $f$ with respect to $P$ is given by\n\n$$\nL(f,P)={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}\\boxed{}\\,Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\n$$\n\nwhere $Δ{x}_{i}={x}_{i}-{x}_{i-1}$ and $Δ{y}_{j}={y}_{j}-{y}_{j-1},$ what is the missing expression in the double summation above?" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544816 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "50a1adba-14a0-5a88-abaf-07e0387210e6" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544816 #edb/ref 1074 "The lower Riemann sum is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{m}_{ij}Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${m}_{ij}$ is the *minimum* value of $f$ in each subregion ${R}_{ij}.$ \n\nWe consider an arbitrary subregion ${R}_{ij}$ of the partition. This subregion lies between ${x}_{i-1}$ and ${x}_{i}$ over the $x$-axis and ${y}_{i-1}$ and ${y}_{i}$ over the $y$-axis, as shown below. \n\n![](images/88/88ffe30ae5401e00502b35d851b216768aad69bf94236561617adf23e1ce058f.png)\n\nNotice that:\n\n- $f(x,y)=2x+y$ increases as $x$ increases, and\n\n- $f(x,y)=2x+y$ increases as $y$ increases.\n\n![](images/67/67daa328cc6ae4cb37be386c327fb4548844fad2adc10476bdf1147c5a5d4218.png)\n\nAs a result, the *minimum* value of $f$ in each subregion is attained when we have the *smallest* possible $x$ and the *smallest* possible $y.$ This is the value at the *bottom left corner* of each subregion. \n\n![](images/51/51808df96cf7dd295bfa24aa3641a601c821116e1a0014898ffe705036704a53.png)\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{m}_{ij} & =f({x}_{i-1},{y}_{j-1})=2{x}_{i-1}+{y}_{j-1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the lower Riemann sum is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(2{x}_{i-1}+{y}_{j-1})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is $2{x}_{i-1}+{y}_{j-1}.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544856 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186544727 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544856 #edb/ref 1069 "q-75307" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544856 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186544856 #edb/ref 1071 "Let $R=[0,2]\\times [1,5]$ be a region in the $xy$-plane, and let $f(x,y)=5{x}^{2}+2{y}^{2}+y.$ Further, let $P$ be a partition of $R,$ where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{1}=\\{{x}_{0},{x}_{1},…,{x}_{m}\\},\\,{P}_{2